<navigation-bar title="每日营养报告" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view><view slot="right" class="share-button" bindtap="refreshReport"><text>更新</text></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="report-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-shell report-page">
  <view class="report-meta"><image src="/assets/baby-avatar-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view><text class="meta-name">{{babyName}}</text><text>{{ageText}}</text></view><view class="date-pill"><text>{{dateLabel}}</text><view class="calendar-small"></view></view></view>
  <view class="overview-card ui-card"><view class="overview-score"><text>整体数据完整度</text><view><text class="big-score">{{coverage}}</text><text>%</text></view><text class="overview-caption">各营养素完整度的平均值</text><text class="praise-pill">{{reportStatus}}</text></view><image src="/assets/baby-eating-focus-v3.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="radar-panel"><view class="radar-title">报告边界 <view class="info-icon">i</view></view><text>仅比较经审核的人群参考规则</text><text>不构成医学诊断或喂养处方</text><text>缺失值不会按零计算</text></view></view>
  <view class="reading-guide ui-card"><text class="guide-title">怎么看这份报告</text><view><text>数据完整度</text><text>表示已确认食物中，有多少份量具备可计算的营养数值。顶部数值是本页各营养素完整度的算术平均值。</text></view><view><text>参考值比较</text><text>本报告不使用容易误解的“达标率”。是否达到参考值，请看每种营养素下方的绿色、橙色或红色结论标签。</text></view></view>
  <view class="intake-card ui-card"><view class="intake-heading"><text class="section-title">营养摄入与参考值比较</text><view class="legend"><view><view class="dot good"></view><text>达到参考</text></view><view><view class="dot warn"></view><text>低于参考或暂不比较</text></view><view><view class="dot danger"></view><text>超过上限</text></view></view></view><view class="intake-grid"><view class="intake-item" wx:for="{{nutrients}}" wx:key="nutrientCode"><view class="nutrient-heading"><view class="nutrient-title"><view class="nutrient-symbol">{{item.badge}}</view><text class="intake-name">{{item.name}}</text></view><text class="status-pill {{item.statusTone}}">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="nutrient-body"><view class="intake-ring" style="background: conic-gradient({{item.ringColor}} {{item.value}}%, #f2e9e4 0)"><view><text>{{item.value}}%</text><text>数据完整度</text></view></view><view class="amount-block"><text>已确认摄入</text><text>{{item.amount}}</text></view></view></view></view><view class="intake-tip"><view class="bulb"></view><text>摄入数值来自已确认食物与实际吃下克数；数据不完整时只展示已知部分，不把缺失值当作零。</text></view></view>
  <view class="insight-card ui-card"><view class="insight-title"><text>数据说明</text><view class="info-badge">i</view></view><view class="highlight-row" wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="warning-dot"></view><text>{{item}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!warnings.length}}" class="highlight-row"><view class="ok-dot"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><text>当前报告没有额外数据说明</text></view></view>
  <view class="streak-card"><image src="/assets/baby-avatar-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view><text>坚持记录是形成可靠参考的第一步</text><text>食材和实际吃下的份量仍需照护者逐项确认</text></view><button bindtap="openRecords">查看记录</button></view>
</view></scroll-view>
<app-tabbar active="report" showCamera="{{true}}"></app-tabbar>
